				<r3d:description language="eng">&lt;&lt;&lt;!!!&lt;&lt;&lt;  stated 13.02.2020: the repository is offline   &gt;&gt;&gt;!!!&lt;&lt;&lt;  Data.DURAARK provides a unique collection of real world datasets from the architectural profession. The repository is unique, as it provides several different datatypes, such as 3d scans, 3d models and classifying Metadata and Geodata, to real world physical buildings.domain.  Many of the datasets stem from architectural stakeholders and provide the community in this way with insights into the range of working methods, which the practice employs on large and complex building data.</r3d:description>
