				<r3d:remarks>In the project, technologies and tools will be developed that allow the long term preservation of semantically enriched building models. This includes devising new methods to enrich interoperable 3D models in the form of the Industry Foundation Classes (IFC) with arbitrary vocabularies provided in the Resource Description Format (RDF) . See also: https://github.com/bfetahu/focused_crawler</r3d:remarks>
